      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "There is a paucity of information regarding insufficiency fractures of the os pubis in rheumatoid arthritis. While only 7 such fractures have been recorded thus far in the English literature, we have encountered 5 os pubis fractures in the past 4-year period. We report these cases to heighten awareness of their existence, describe their sometimes misleading clinical presentations, and to discuss possible etiologic factors."},
